+# Balmond v5 implementation check — 31 October 2026
+
+## V5 change
+
+The user's requested S1 trail scale adjustment is applied to the existing supplied asset: the sheet is uniformly downscaled from 543x181 to 354x118, approximately 65.2% (closest integer-pixel representation of the requested 65%). The six frame crops are updated from 90.5x181 to 59x118. Frame durations, body animation, VFX trigger, and follow binding are unchanged. No art was regenerated.
+
+V5 carries forward the v4 S1 caster attachment, S2 EnemyWithoutTower target at 35,000 plus explicit 180-tick `skill2` animation trigger, and Ultimate caster visual plus approximate 30-tick `ult` body-animation trigger. Damage code and formulas are unchanged.
+
+## Validation and limitations
+
+The v5 static audit checks 78+ structural assertions, including exact scaled atlas dimensions and frame crop bounds. A clean audit does not establish how the rescaled trail looks in TFM2. No complete source/SDK build or in-game test has been performed; no runtime ZIP is included. S2's target enum may still include jungle units, and Ultimate fan orientation remains unverified.

